WEBVTT

00:00:07.780 --> 00:00:08.260
Del: Let's go!

00:00:08.400 --> 00:00:11.000
Iden: Del, get us outta here!

00:00:11.080 --> 00:00:11.640
Del: I'm on it!

00:00:40.300 --> 00:00:41.060
Hask: Admiral Versio.

00:00:42.800 --> 00:00:46.340
Hask: Agent Hask, reporting. Mission accomplished, sir.

00:01:02.820 --> 00:01:05.400
Garrick: Congratulations, Commander Hask.

00:01:22.420 --> 00:01:32.040
Iden: So, we’re not completely alone. Some of the crew stayed with us. Protected the refugees against those who wouldn't.

00:01:32.940 --> 00:01:33.620
Del: How are they?

00:01:36.420 --> 00:01:40.960
Iden: Shaken. Confused. But safe.

00:01:48.400 --> 00:01:50.080
Iden: Just want to know what's next.

00:01:51.600 --> 00:01:52.780
Del: We have to warn people.

00:01:52.780 --> 00:02:01.880
Iden: Who? The Rebels? They're just going to toss us in Sunspot Prison before we can even say a word.

00:02:03.700 --> 00:02:11.560
Del: That’s why I think you should just take the **Corvus** and go. Leave me a TIE fighter. I’ll set off a distress call, wait for the Rebels to find me.

00:02:14.540 --> 00:02:17.600
Iden: You really think I'm gonna let you just float out here alone?

00:02:19.120 --> 00:02:26.300
Iden: Del. We're Inferno Squad. You and me.
